  "description": "<p data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"370\">Spring terug in klassiek retro-plezier met <em data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"230\">Frogger’s Adventure: Temple of the Frog</em> voor de <strong data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"260\">Nintendo Game Boy</strong>! Neem de controle over Frogger en ga op een vrolijk en uitdagend avontuur vol obstakels, puzzels en vijanden.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"375\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"401\">📦 Productinformatie</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"586\">\r\n<li data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"437\">\r\n<p data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"437\"><strong data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"417\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Game Boy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"494\">\r\n<p data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"494\"><strong data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"450\">Titel:</strong> <em data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"492\">Frogger’s Adventure: Temple of the Frog</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"528\">\r\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"528\"><strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"507\">Genre:</strong> Action / Adventure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"561\">\r\n<p data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"561\"><strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"546\">Speelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"586\">\r\n<p data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"586\"><strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"577\">Leeftijd:</strong> PEGI 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"591\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"604\">✅ Staat</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"782\">\r\n<li data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"628\">\r\n<p data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"628\">Originele cartridge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"653\"><strong data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"651\">Origineel doosje</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"682\">\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"682\"><strong data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"680\">Boekje / handleiding</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"713\">\r\n<p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"713\">Getest en volledig werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"782\">\r\n<p data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"782\">Nette staat (normale gebruikssporen passend bij leeftijd mogelijk)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"787\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"823\">🐸 Waarom Frogger’s Adventure?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"1009\">\r\n<li data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"876\">\r\n<p data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"876\">Klassieke Game Boy-actie met avontuurlijke twist</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"928\">\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"928\">Vertrouwde Frogger-gameplay met extra uitdaging</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<p data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"962\">Gewaardeerd door retro gamers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1009\">\r\n<p data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1009\">Compleet exemplaar verhoogt verzamelwaarde</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1031\">🛡 Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1135\">Bij Used Products ontvang je standaard garantie op je aankoop.<br data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1097\">Veilig en vertrouwd tweedehands kopen.</p>",
